The Seesam Health Insurance app is the most convenient way to use the Health Insurance Service.

With the options provided by the Seesam app:
 * Ditch the plastic – use a mobile app instead of a plastic card;
 * Use the card barcode to conveniently pay for services;
 * Submit claims by simply taking a photo with your phone. Track the status of each claim;
 * Have a clear overview on services that you policy covers and track your limits;
 * Choose the language of the app – Lithuanian, English or Russian.


Приложение Seesam – самый удобный способ пользоваться услугой страхования Здоровья.

С помощью приложения:
